Feature: Trace verification
  Each requirement's verification status is traceable from executed test results.

  @item-01-005
  Scenario: RDM shall read the spec's user needs from the source its configuration names: by default each Gherkin Feature, its description the need's text, addressed by the scenarios under it; or the Allium adapter (each event-model screen with the surfaces it links, their actors, provided rules and guarantees, and the event-storm events its commands produce; each surface where a context has no screens), a requirement addressing the needs whose rules or guarantees it covers; a requirement linked to no need traces to the needs of its own context.
